---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Pioneer Portal
permalink: /pioneers/index.html
description: Fall 2026 Fight for Manhood leader schedule and teaching resources.
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="portal-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ site.name }} &middot; Leadership</span>
      <h1>Pioneer Portal</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">Fall 2026 leader documents, guided notes, teaching resources, and the week-by-week schedule.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="portal-update" aria-labelledby="pioneer-update-heading">
      <h2 id="pioneer-update-heading">Fall 2026 curriculum is set</h2>
      <p>The cohort runs Tuesday, September 15 through Tuesday, November 17 at {{ site.cohort.time }}. The uploaded ten chapters are the content authority. Supplemental resources for Weeks 9 and 10 still need to be posted.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1C-KS2Lc26QuAhQO2rGROsecNAKM5mgvh/edit?usp=drive_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Attendee contact list</a>
      <a class="button" href="/program/">Review curriculum</a>
    </div>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="leader-schedule-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="leader-schedule-heading">Week-by-week documents</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The first column remains visible while you scroll the document table on smaller screens.</p>
      <div class="resource-panel">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Week</th><th>Questions</th><th>Slide deck</th><th>Leader guide</th><th>Guided notes</th><th>Scripture</th><th>Video</th><th>Chapter</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for item in curriculum %}
              {% set resource = resources[loop.index0] %}
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Week {{ item.week }}</strong><br><span class="muted">{{ item.date | isoDate }}<br>{{ item.title }}</span></td>
                {% for key in ["questions", "slides", "leader", "notes", "scripture", "video", "chapter"] %}
                  <td>{% if resource[key] %}<a href="{{ resource[key] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open</a>{% else %}<span class="status">Pending</span>{% endif %}</td>
                {% endfor %}
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
